{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000dcd9","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c88a-6674-7861-9d70-d3e79e98c472"},"sequence":3271,"recorded_at":1780531400006537,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"995ec337-5e4d-4fd4-a64e-ae914055ec56","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"995ec337-5e4d-4fd4-a64e-ae914055ec56","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"995ec337-5e4d-4fd4-a64e-ae914055ec56"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c8a4-6455-7a82-8a98-07f8ca6de3dd"},"task_id":"01a0c8a4-6455-7a82-8a98-07f8ca6de3dd","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c8a4-6455-7a82-8a98-07f8ca6de3dd","chunk":"Read text file `README.md`.\n(2394 line(s) above)\n2395|Reconcile/ResolveEvidence admission consumed as an `Admitted` set\n2396|composed only with generation equality: a missing realm row or a\n2397|stale-generation admission refuses, so a cached observation replayed as\n2398|live authorizes nothing. Every broker, server, and spawner interaction\n2399|runs through injected dependencies, so the suite passes with no tmux\n2400|process anywhere; native Windows refuses every request. Lifecycle\n2401|operations — create, attach, status, quiesce, safe-boundary, stop,\n2402|stale termination, restore — run through structured argv builders over\n2403|the dedicated socket: `Execute` admits exactly the eight operations\n2404|and refuses unknown ones, the exec adapter reconstructs the exact\n2405|`tmux -S <socket> <subcommand>` vector per operation and refuses\n2406|forged binaries, flag injection, and ambient socket discovery, and\n2407|the probed socket generation is bound (B18-B20) before any execution.\n2408|Bodies are pure argv builders whose stable pane entrypoint stays\n2409|`ax pane SESSION_ID`; effects run through the landed terminstance\n2410|engine with strict per-operation deadlines, generation rechecks, and\n2411|AX-side state memory for reconciliation, while attach, terminate, and\n2412|restore mirror the landed backend, fencing, and axpane gates. Quiesce\n2413|cuts operator input by locking then detaching every attached client\n2414|and refusing new input-authorized attaches at the entry (read-only\n2415|observation stays); the boundary waits blocking for the wrapper\n2416|signal with the proof kind bound into its evidence; probes prove\n2417|absence only from marked tmux stderr and read every other failure as\n2418|unknown. Every mutating operation replays the identical request\n2419|idempotently; uncertain receipts reconcile through status before\n2420|resuming.\n2421|\n2422|Run the focused tests and coverage with:\n2423|\n2424|```bash\n2425|go test ./internal/tmuxserver -count=1\n2426|go test ./internal/tmuxserver -cover -count=1\n2427|```\n2428|\n2429|Run the narrowing battery (269 narrowing mutants, three supplementary\n2430|additive rows, plus one harmless control) with:\n2431|\n2432|```bash\n2433|PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py\n2434|```\n2435|\n2436|The harness mutates one production file in place, runs the named killer\n2437|through the production entry point, restores the file from backup, and\n2438|reports per-row verdicts with subprocess exits; `AX_MUTANT_VERBOSE=1`\n2439|additionally prints the raw per-plant logs, and `--log-dir` captures one\n2440|raw log per plant. Task validation logs and mutation artifacts are\n2441|attached to `TASK-260830-35urbp`, with the lifecycle battery and its\n2442|raw per-plant logs attached to `TASK-260830-1c28dz`. The package adds\n2443|no `ax` command, no\n2444|`doctor` result, and no runtime capability claim; the clause-to-test\n2445|matrix with its stated bounds lives in\n2446|[the task evidence map](internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md).\n2447|\n2448|## Ownership reducer properties\n2449|\n2450|The four story-pinned ownership invariants (pinned v0.6.0 Sections 2.2, 5.3,\n2451|and 13.6-13.10) hold as executable property tests over the landed production\n2452|reducers — `sessstate.Reduce` with `Compare` and the union projection,\n2453|`sessrepo.WinningLease` with `ListLeases`, and `fencing.Authorize*`:\n2454|\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
