ce=34 matrix=68 DIFFERS\\n  trace-only: 0 matrix-only: 0\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 128,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 32,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
